[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6483.59, "timestamp": "01:48:03", "text": "探索して、いくつかのエリアを100%制覇しようとしているだけです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6486.629, "timestamp": "01:48:06", "text": "隅から隅まで、あらゆる場所をくまなく探した"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6489.83, "timestamp": "01:48:09", "text": "。  [笑い] 何も"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6492.31, "timestamp": "01:48:12", "text": "ない隅っこまで行って、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6502.709, "timestamp": "01:48:22", "text": "このゲームにはやることが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6506.79, "timestamp": "01:48:26", "text": "たくさんあるんだよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6508.79, "timestamp": "01:48:28", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6512.55, "timestamp": "01:48:32", "text": "そんなに。 とても多くの要素が含まれています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6514.629, "timestamp": "01:48:34", "text": "だから、これに関しては彼に十分な時間をかけてもらうことができる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6516.39, "timestamp": "01:48:36", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6536.95, "timestamp": "01:48:56", "text": "何ですか？"}]